  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Exquisite was printed in association with the SCAD Atlanta leg of the traveling exhibition, Pretty in Ink, in Trois Gallery. This single sheet folded artists' book was letterpress printed, rubber-stamped and screenprinted in the SCAD Atlanta printmaking studios in September 2013. The typefaces are Bordeaux Roman Bold LET and Bodoni. The paper is French Pop-Tine (100 lb. cover Razzle Berry)." Edition of 40.- from the cover. </subfield>
  </datafield>
